If a patient has an oxycodone-prescription then every clinician should order an oxycodone-specific-toxicology-testing for the patient.
If a patient receives a prescribed-nonmorphine-based-opioid then every clinician should order a specific-toxicology-testing for the prescribed-nonmorphine-based-opioid for the patient.
A nonmorphine-based-opioid-example includes a buprenorphine-example and includes a methadone-example.
